## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Core Service & PostgreSQL Layer
- `package.json` & `tsconfig.json`: TypeScript, Express, `pg`, `zod`, `pino`, `prom-client`, `vitest`.
- `src/config/index.ts`: Config schema for DB, WhatsApp, and Department.
- `src/store/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql`: PostgreSQL DDL schema (`student_contacts`, `conversations`, `messages`, `requirements`, `faq_entries`, `form_configs`, `audit_events`).
- `src/store/db.ts` & `src/store/migrate.ts`: Connection pool with health checks and migration runner.
- `src/store/repositories/`: PostgreSQL repositories for contacts, conversations, messages, requirements, FAQs, and forms.

### Phase 2: WhatsApp Layer (`src/adapters/whatsapp/`)
- `src/adapters/whatsapp/types.ts`: TypeScript interfaces for Meta WhatsApp Cloud API webhooks and outbound message schemas.
- `src/adapters/whatsapp/signature.ts`: HMAC-SHA256 signature verifier for `X-Hub-Signature-256`.
- `src/adapters/whatsapp/normalizer.ts`: Parser extracting sender phone, text, message ID, timestamp.
- `src/adapters/whatsapp/client.ts`: Outbound message sender supporting plain text and interactive button/URL payloads.
- `src/routes/webhook.ts`: Express router handling `GET /webhooks/whatsapp` (challenge) and `POST /webhooks/whatsapp` (events).

### Phase 3: Domain Engine & Business Logic
- `src/core/state-machine.ts`: State transitions (`NEW`, `UNDERSTANDING`, `FAQ_ANSWERING`, `REQUIREMENT_INTAKE`, `FORM_PENDING`, `HUMAN_REVIEW`, `CLOSED`).
- `src/core/classifier.ts`: Keyword & rule-based classification and risk/safety escalation detection.
- `src/core/orchestrator.ts`: Pipeline coordinating idempotency, support hours, FAQ retrieval, requirement creation, and response formatting.
- `src/services/faq-service.ts`: Knowledge retrieval from approved department FAQ list.
- `src/services/form-registry.ts`: Resolves active Google Form link per category.
- `src/services/notification-service.ts`: HOD/admin alert notifications.

### Phase 4: Internal APIs & Observability
- `src/routes/requirements.ts`: `GET` and `PATCH` for HOD/admin to manage requests.
- `src/routes/forms-sync.ts`: Endpoint to sync Google Form submissions back to student requirement records.
- `src/routes/health.ts`: `/health/live` and `/health/ready` (DB ping).
- `src/routes/metrics.ts`: Prometheus `/metrics` exporter.

### Phase 5: DevOps Production Toolkit
- `Dockerfile`: Production multi-stage Alpine build (non-root `node` user, dumb-init).
- `docker-compose.yml`: Local multi-container setup (API + PostgreSQL 16).
- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: Automated lint, typecheck, test with PostgreSQL container, audit, and container build.
- `.github/workflows/cd.yml`: Production container build & push to GitHub Container Registry (`ghcr.io`).
- `k8s/`: Kubernetes manifests (`deployment.yaml`, `service.yaml`, `ingress.yaml`, `configmap.yaml`, `secret.yaml`, `hpa.yaml`).
- `terraform/`: Infrastructure as Code for RDS PostgreSQL and container deployment.

### Phase 6: Local Simulator & Verification
- `src/simulator/cli.ts`: Interactive terminal chat simulator to test the bot without live WhatsApp credentials.
- `tests/`: Automated unit & integration tests for webhook verification, idempotency, FAQ matching, escalation, and requirement creation.

